m/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- reproducible in v4.4.stable\n- reproducible in v4.4.beta1\n- reproducible in v4.4.beta3\n- **not** reproducible on macOS\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700KF CPU @ 3.80GHz (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe engine crashes almost consistently (4 out of 5 times) when I use the Inspector search function to search for \"font\" on a Label node while the property \"font_size\" is marked as favorite. It does **not** happen with other properties I tested, also not with another font property like \"font_color\". \n\nIt also does **not** happen on RichTextLabel, only on regular Label\n\nI've tried on both the 4.4 release and the beta1 with the same behavior. File Logging is turned on but I don't seem to have a log folder in userdata. Does not happen on macOS as far as I tested.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a User Interface scene\n2. Add Label\n3. mark \"font_size\" on Label as favorite\n4. search \"font\" in inspector search bar\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19336502/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.